  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Corporacin Administrativa para el Poder Judicial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inst. Streng. Judicial Branch Adm. Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program would contemplate: (i) the improvement of human resources administration; (ii) the consolidation of the decision-making judiciary statistical system; and (iii) the organizational reengineering of the Administrative Corporation of the Judiciary (CAPJ), including the foundations for its administrative decentralization.</narrative>
